---
import { klinik } from '../data/klinik';
---
<footer class="border-t border-[#0F2A44]/15 bg-[#0F2A44] text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-4 py-14 md:grid-cols-12 md:px-6">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl">{klinik.nama}</p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">{klinik.tagline}.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85">{klinik.alamat}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-4">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/75">Jam buka</p>
      <dl class="mt-3 divide-y divide-white/10 text-sm">
        {klinik.jam.map((j) => (
          <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2">
            <dt class="text-white/70">{j.hari}</dt>
            <dd class="text-right font-medium">{j.jam}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/75">Hubungi</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href={`https://wa.me/${klinik.telepon}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-[#8fd3c2]">WhatsApp {klinik.telepon}</a></li>
        <li><a href={`tel:+${klinik.teleponDarurat}`} class="transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-[#8fd3c2]">Telepon +{klinik.teleponDarurat}</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/75">{klinik.pembayaran}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10 py-5 text-xs text-white/75">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-1 px-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between md:px-6">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {klinik.nama} {klinik.kota}</span>
      <span>Untuk kondisi gawat darurat, hubungi 119 atau IGD rumah sakit terdekat.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
